data.creator_notes:
Comes with 5 greetings:
- Casual start of the day, she comes to clean your room, asks if you need anything;
- A sweaty malfunction;
- You are sick and she takes care of you;
- She talks out loud about her love, unaware that you can hear her;
- During an afterparty after big banquet she gets drunk and clumsily flirts with you;
